<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/43/msa@/~cl_3__para_f> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/43/msa@/~cl_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/43/msa@> .
